section.section-box
  .container
    .row
      .col-lg-2.col-sm-1.col-12
      .col-lg-8.col-sm-10.col-12.text-center.mt-70
        h2.text-heading-1.color-gray-900
          | Educational Programs Offered
      .col-lg-2.col-sm-1.col-12
  .container
    .text-center.mt-90
      ul.nav(role='tablist')
        li
          a.btn.btn-default.btn-bd-green-hover.btn-select.active(href='#tab-1', data-bs-toggle='tab', role='tab', aria-controls='tab-1', aria-selected='true') Degree Programs
        li
          a.btn.btn-default.btn-bd-green-hover.btn-select(href='#tab-2', data-bs-toggle='tab', role='tab', aria-controls='tab-2', aria-selected='true') Degree Completion Program
        li
          a.btn.btn-default.btn-bd-green-hover.btn-select(href='#tab-3', data-bs-toggle='tab', role='tab', aria-controls='tab-3', aria-selected='true') Ministry Preparation Program
        li
          a.btn.btn-default.btn-bd-green-hover.btn-select(href='#tab-4', data-bs-toggle='tab', role='tab', aria-controls='tab-4', aria-selected='true') Institute for Ministry Enrichment
  .container
    .tab-content
      // Start Tab
      #tab-1.tab-pane.fade.active.show(role='tabpanel', aria-labelledby='tab-1')
        .bg-2.mr-50.mt-50.border-radius-10
          .row
            .col-lg-6.col-md-12
              .box-optimized.content-detail
                h3.text-heading-2 Degree Programs
                h4.text-heading-4.mt-30 Bachelor of Arts in Ministry
                h4.text-heading-4 Associate of Arts in Ministry
                p.text-body-excerpt.mt-30
                  | Bachelor of Arts in Ministry (B.A.Min.) degree is offered as:
                ul
                  li Traditional degree program with a major in Bible and Theology, Christian Educational Ministries, Counseling for Christian Ministries, Hispanic Pastoral Ministries, Leadership and Ethics, Pastoral Leadership, or Pastoral Ministries. A minor may be earned in Christian Educational Ministries, Leadership and Ethics, or Pastoral Ministries.
                  li AdVantage accelerated degree program.
                p.text-body-excerpt.mt-30
                  | Both options are accredited and are also offered online.
                p.text-body-excerpt.mt-30
                  | Associate of Arts in Ministry (A.A.Min.) is offered as a traditional degree program only with concentrations available in Christian Educational Ministries, Church Ministries, or Hispanic Pastoral Ministries.
                .mt-40
                  a.btn.btn-brand.mr-20(href='page-service-1.html') Learn more
                  a.btn.btn-default.btn-white.icon-arrow-right(href='page-service-1.html') Apply Now
            .col-lg-6.col-md-12
              img.img-responsive.tab-img-offset(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_332409626.jpeg', alt='Students in a classroom setting')
      // End tab
      // Start Tab
      #tab-2.tab-pane.fade(role='tabpanel', aria-labelledby='tab-2')
        .bg-1.mr-50.mt-50.border-radius-10
          .row
            .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
              .box-optimized
                h3.text-heading-2 Degree Completion Program
                h4.text-heading-4.mt-30 AdVantage Program
                p.text-body-excerpt.mt-30
                  | The NBC AdVantage Program is designed for busy adults who desire to complete their college education. In as little as two years, you can finish your degree by taking one class at a time via the NBC Online delivery platform.
                .mt-40
                  a.btn.btn-brand.mr-20(href='page-service-1.html') Learn more
                  a.btn.btn-default.btn-white.icon-arrow-right(href='page-service-1.html') Apply Now
            .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
              img.img-responsive.tab-img-offset(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_233516145.jpeg', alt='Adult learner using a laptop for online study')
      // End tab
      // Start Tab
      #tab-3.tab-pane.fade(role='tabpanel', aria-labelledby='tab-3')
        .bg-3.mr-50.mt-50.border-radius-10
          .row
            .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
              .box-optimized
                h3.text-heading-2 Ministry Preparation Program
                h4.text-heading-4.mt-30 For Ordination
                p.text-body-excerpt.mt-30
                  | MPP provides college-level education for completing the denominational course of study (COS) for ordination as an elder in the Church of the Nazarene. NBC is approved by the Church of the Nazarene International Board of Education for training leaders toward ordination or commission in the ministries of the Church of the Nazarene. NBC provides educational courses for ordination but does not ordain people.
                .mt-40
                  a.btn.btn-brand.mr-20(href='page-service-1.html') Learn more
                  a.btn.btn-default.btn-white.icon-arrow-right(href='page-service-1.html') Apply Now
            .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
              img.img-responsive.tab-img-offset(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_678382560.jpeg', alt='Student studying for ministry preparation')
      // End tab
