          .row
            .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
              .box-optimized
                h3.text-heading-2 Institute for Ministry Enrichment
                h4.text-heading-4.mt-30 Continuing Education and Lifelong Learning
                p.text-body-excerpt.mt-30
                  | For pastors and ministry leaders who want to continue their Christian education, NBC’s Institute for Ministry Enrichment is a high quality, low cost program available online. This opportunity is designed to benefit leaders from all denominations.
                .mt-40
                  a.btn.btn-brand.mr-20(href='page-service-1.html') Learn more
                  a.btn.btn-default.btn-white.icon-arrow-right(href='page-service-1.html') Apply Now
